Histogram diff, modified copy

The files `../histogram.rs`, `lcs.rs` and `list_pool.rs` are copied from
gix-imara-diff 0.3.3 (https://crates.io/crates/gix-imara-diff, source in
https://github.com/GitoxideLabs/gitoxide), which is gitoxide's maintained copy
of imara-diff (https://github.com/pascalkuthe/imara-diff, upstream commit
32d1e45d3df061e6ccba6db7fdce92db29e345d8).

Authors of gix-imara-diff: Pascal Kuthe and Sebastian Thiel, with the
imara-diff and gitoxide contributors.

