Changes made for diffyman:
- A deterministic work counter and budget. Past the budget, the regions still
  to be diffed use Myers instead of Histogram.
- The left-part recursion is an explicit stack with the same visiting order.
- The Myers fallback goes through the public `Diff::compute_with` API.
- Import paths, and comments marking each change.

When no budget is hit, the output is identical to gix-imara-diff 0.3.3
`Algorithm::Histogram` on the same tokens.
